{"lemmaChirho":"H2205","glossChirho":"זָקֵן","fromChirho":43,"toChirho":3,"notesChirho":"elder/community leader (Korean 장로, 30 clusters) + old/aged person (Korean 늙은/노인) + old woman (Arabic عَجَائِز, different root). Korean 장로 vs 노인 is decisive."}
{"lemmaChirho":"H2232","glossChirho":"זרע","fromChirho":43,"toChirho":5,"notesChirho":"sow seed (Qal) + be sown (Nif/Pual passive) + yield seed (Hifil, Gen 1) + conceive/become pregnant (Arabic حَبِلَ, Korean 잉태하다) + scatter/disperse (Korean 흩트리다). Conception sense confirmed by non-agricultural vocab in all languages."}
